
(empty-handed)
	~(* has parent #player)

%% ENTRA
#mine-entrance
(room *)
(name *)	Mine Entrance
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	You are standing at the entrance of what might have been a coal mine. To
	the northeast and the northwest are entrances to the mine, and there is
	another exit on the south end of the room.
(from * go #south to #slide-room)
(from * go #northwest to #squeaky-room)
(from * go #northeast to #shaft-room)

%% SQUEE
#squeaky-room
(room *)
(name *)	Squeaky Room
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	You are a small room. Strange squeaky sounds may be heard coming from
	the passage at the west end. You may also escape to the south.
(from * go #west to #bat-room)
(from * go #south to #mine-entrance)

%% TSHAF
#shaft-room
(room *)
(name *)	Shaft Room
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	You are in a large room, in the middle of which is a small shaft
	descending through the floor into darkness below. To the west and the
	north are exits from this room. Constructed over the top of the shaft is
	a metal framework to which a heavy iron chain is attached.
(narrate failing to leave * #down)
	You wouldn't fit and would die if you could.
(from * go #west to #mine-entrance)
(from * go #north to #wooden-tunnel)

%% TUNNE
#wooden-tunnel
(room *)
(name *)	Wooden Tunnel
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	You are in a narrow tunnel with large wooden beams running across the
	ceiling and around the walls. A path from the south splits into paths
	running west and northeast.
(from * go #south to #shaft-room)
(from * go #west to #smelly-room)
(from * go #northeast to #coalmine1)

%% SMELL
#smelly-room
(room *)
(name *)	Smelly Room
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	You are in a small non-descript room. However, from the direction of a
	small descending staircase a foul odor can be detected. To the east is a
	narrow path.
(from * go #down to #gas-room)
(from * go #east to #wooden-tunnel)

%% BOOM
#gas-room
(room *)
(name *)	Gas Room
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	You are in a small room which smells strongly of coal gas.
%% TODO: room action routine BOOM-ROOM
(from * go #up to #smelly-room)

%% TLADD
#ladder-top
(room *)
(name *)	Ladder Top
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	You are in a very small room. In the corner is a rickety wooden ladder,
	leading downward. It might be safe to descend. There is also a staircase
	leading upward.
(from * go #down to #ladder-bottom)
(from * go #up to #coalmine7)

